   "ঘ": "4"
  },
  "answer_key": "খ",
  "answer_pointer": null,
  "guide_solution": null,
  "explanation": "(√5)^(x+3) = (√(5⁴))^(2x−1)\n5^((x+3)/2) = 5^((4/2)(2x−1))\n(x+3)/2 = 2(2x−1)\n4(2x−1) = x+3\n8x − 4 = x+3\n8x − x = 3+4\n7x = 7\nx = 7/7 = 1",
